    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i think i got a uti or smth... it burns so bad when i pee and my lower stomach feels super heavy. i also started getting this sharp pain in my side/back area too. i rly dont wanna go to the doctor or take antibiotics if i dont have to, is there like a way i can just kill the infection with stuff like oregano oil or super high doses of cranberry extract? i just need to know what to take so i can handle this at home.",
